    "body": "Raised from P6 to **P4** at the request of mkinney (2026-11-20): \"We can raise priority ourselves on 1880. I want that for my Wazer. I'm guessing it's essential for plasma users, too.\"\n\nWhy it matters now: hobby router, plasma and desktop waterjet users usually have an SVG (from Inkscape, a vinyl or laser workflow, or a sign design), not a 3D model or a DXF. A Discord user with a WorkBee router (2026-11-20) does not use 3D CAM because making a 3D part from a 2D sketch is too much work. SVG import is the shortest path from their drawing to a toolpath, beside the DXF import of #1452 / #1863.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
